WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.160
Wake up!

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.750
Big Sis! Big Sis! Big Sis!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.120
Sister...

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.080
Brother... Ow!

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.750
Ow! My leg!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.040
It's broken! What now, Big Sis?!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.000
Don't worry. I'm okay, so don't worry.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
No, you're not! Your leg won't heal like ours!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.160
I said I'm okay. A broken leg
isn't gonna kill me.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:52.830
What in the world happened?

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.700
The <i>Shinkansen</i>...

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:10.410
Courier! You're all right, too! Thank goodness!

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:12.250
Your hand!

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.790
The bike's fine.

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:17.660
You're such a moron to care
more about your bike!

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.410
You've got a rotten mouth, shithead.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.700
Right back at you.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.950
"Akudama Drive"

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.660
Hello! Bunny here!

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:32.660
'Sup?! It's Shark here!

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:37.250
Hey, Shark! Do you know why
these bad things are happening?

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.450
Because of the people who opposed Kanto!

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.580
That's right!

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:48.330
They came and stole the offerings
that were meant to keep Kanto safe!

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.620
What a mean thing to do!
All Kanto wants is harmony!

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:56.450
Super S-Rank Akudama sure are vile people!

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:00.080
If Kanto falls apart, Kansai's in real trouble!

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:07.370
People of Kansai! The Executioners are
working hard to eliminate the Akudama!

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:11.660
Let's support the Executioners
who protect all of us!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.250
Big Sis! Hang in there!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.700
It's over.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:43.540
We can't run anymore. It's only
a matter of time till we're found.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:48.200
Once that happens,
they'll execute you two right away.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:52.410
And we'll be taken back to be vessels for Kanto.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.410
Brother...

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:59.200
Stop that. I promised I'd help
you escape, no matter what!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:03.410
Thank you, but you've already done enough.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:07.450
You took us to Expo Park
and brought us together again.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:12.870
Don't say that. I protected you this far,
so let me keep my promise!

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.580
Not all can be kept.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:19.250
But all of them have!
Everyone's kept their promise!

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:24.370
You protected me! Big Sis let me see you again!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.910
It only worked 'cuz we didn't give up!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.910
I'm sorry, but there's nothing we--

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.410
Shut up! Why are you giving up?!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:36.580
Nothing's happened yet!
Big Sis hasn't given up yet!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:40.830
We're still not vessels for Kanto yet!

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.040
Get off, shithead!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.580
Courier.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.830
This is 500 yen.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.200
Say that you'll take it.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.410
What?

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:20.040
This is all the money I have left.
Take the kids--

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.080
I keep telling you--dropped money is bad luck.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.790
Bad luck is putting it lightly!

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:31.660
Picking up this coin is the sole reason
that I became an Akudama.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:37.950
I lived with criminals, I killed people,
and nearly died who knows how many times.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.620
Now I'll never have a normal life.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.000
That's the price for taking it.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.120
Bad luck doesn't even begin to describe it.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:52.410
It took my normal life and
made it the absolute worst.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:57.750
But this single coin has changed
my life like none other has.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.790
This coin has the power to change
people's lives in a huge way!

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:07.120
Isn't that worth more than any amount?

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:15.410
It'll change your life and the kids' lives,
so take this 500 yen and accept my job.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.750
Courier! Deliver the children to Shikoku!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.750
You're a selfish woman.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:31.410
I'm fine with that.
Because I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.450
You damn Akudama.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.450
There's nothing I can't deliver.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:39.410
Courier...

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:41.910
So get off me, shithead!

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:45.950
In the end, women who climb to the top win.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:53.200
Can we just come back when there's
less dust? I don't want bronchitis.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.950
You'll get workers' comp.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.620
Think they survived the blast?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.540
Jeez! Let's kill 'em and go home!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:04.040
Movement confirmed. Movement confirmed.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.700
They're in your hands now.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.250
Come with us, Big Sis!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.830
I'm afraid I can't.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:19.580
The Executioners will come soon,
and I have to stall them.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:23.080
In that shape? How?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.200
Big Sis... Actually, I think I'll stay--

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.830
No!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.830
You two have to escape!

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:35.250
Because this is something you decided to do.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.870
Please help! I'm an ordinary citizen!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.160
A citizen?

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.410
Could be. I don't recognize her.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:48.660
Something... we decided.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:52.830
Yup. So you gotta see it through till the end.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:57.790
No matter what happens. No matter the sacrifice.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.700
Then we'd be Akudama.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:03.830
After all you've done,
you're the biggest Akudama of all.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.000
Akudama...

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.410
Try to escape while I distract them.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.450
Just who do you think I am?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:19.000
Courier, to be sentenced 745 years.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.290
Don't die, Big Sis!

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.040
Just who do you think I am?

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.200
I was caught up in the explosion! I live nearby!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.700
--There was a huge boom and
the <i>Shinkansen </i>came crashing down!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.700
--Hey! This is why I said
we should evacuate first!
--There was a huge boom and
the <i>Shinkansen </i>came crashing down!

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:40.790
I checked the Akudama list.
She looks different, but it's her.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:44.370
I stole goods from the <i>Shinkansen</i>'s vault.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:49.250
I'm the Super S-Rank Akudama
who plunged Kansai into chaos.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.750
"Broadcasting"
"Kansai"
"Live Broadcast"

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.750
I don't have anywhere to go now!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.620
I don't have anywhere to go now!

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:56.500
My parents got called Akudama and were killed!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.700
I swear I'm not an Akudama!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.870
I...

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.660
I'm an ordinary citizen!

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:06.750
I... am Swindler!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.250
"Kansai"
"Police"

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:14.290
"Naniwa"

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.540
"Naniwa"
"Swindler"
"Estimated Sentence - ??? years"

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.200
Quit your whining.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.950
We're sick of hearing your
pathetic lies, Swindler.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.790
I will execute you!

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.660
Serves you right.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:36.500
She's smiling. That's so creepy.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.830
Swindler has been executed.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.000
Good work.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.540
"Kansai Police Station"
"Chief's Office"

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.790
"Kansai Police Station"
"Chief's Office"

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.790
Just now, a drone spotted Courier
and the offerings heading to the west.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.540
Just now, a drone spotted Courier
and the offerings heading to the west.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.950
Understood. In pursuit.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.950
We're blocking the roads wherever we can.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:59.950
He'll be driven into a corner
by us Executioners.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:08.790
"Kansai"
"Kansai Police Station"

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.250
"Kansai"
"Kansai Police Station"

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.250
How nice of you to come,
Super S-Rank Akudama, Courier.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.250
How nice of you to come,
Super S-Rank Akudama, Courier.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:19.450
We're taking back the offerings.
Right after we kill you.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.500
We... will execute you.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.200
"License to Kill"

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.200
We... will execute you.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:36.120
