00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:25.950
Quit your whining.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:30.750
Executioners are killing people
who are just ordinary citizens!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.370
This is an abuse of power!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:38.040
They might start killing the rest
of us whenever they feel like it!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:43.500
If we don't do something,
our lives and freedom will be in danger!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:46.910
We've gotta join together and take a stand!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:51.910
This video's on every hologram,
not to mention every phone in the city!

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:52.790
Make it stop!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:53.700
--If I could, I would!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.250
--This pisses me off!
--If I could, I would!

00:13:55.250 --> 00:14:00.750
What the hell?!
This makes us look like Akudama...

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.250
Who could have pulled this off?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.370
Big Sis?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.080
"Emergency Program"
"Executing"

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.080
This hacking shit is <i>not </i>happening!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:23.000
You damn idiots!
You'll believe anything you hear!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:28.450
Chief?! Excellent! Declare these idiots Akudama!

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:33.700
Do it and I'll give 'em the
death penalty! I <i>can </i>end this!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.040
Yes... The death penalty...

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.250
--What?!
--I'm sorry...

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.580
You idiot!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.250
Hold on, shitty brats.

